    "lang": "CSS",
    "source": "content/ref/css-animation.json",
    "markdown": "Negative values are invalid and the browser drops the whole declaration. Below one second, milliseconds are easier to compare at a glance. Past roughly 400ms the effect starts to feel like waiting rather than feedback.",
    "html": "<p>Negative values are invalid and the browser drops the whole declaration. Below one second, milliseconds are easier to compare at a glance. Past roughly 400ms the effect starts to feel like waiting rather than feedback.</p>"
