    "lang": "CSS",
    "source": "content/ref/css-animation.json",
    "markdown": "Comma separated layers are matched against the longhand lists by position, and a shorter list repeats from its first value.\n\nImportant detail: writing `transition` resets all four longhands. A delay set in an earlier rule is cleared by a later shorthand that omits it, because the missing value goes back to `0s`.",
    "html": "<p>Comma separated layers are matched against the longhand lists by position, and a shorter list repeats from its first value.</p>\n<p>Important detail: writing <code>transition</code> resets all four longhands. A delay set in an earlier rule is cleared by a later shorthand that omits it, because the missing value goes back to <code>0s</code>.</p>"
