    "group": "Maps",
    "name": "HashMap put and get",
    "syntax": "map.put(key, value); map.get(key)",
    "desc": "Stores a value under a key and reads it back. Average cost is constant; one null key and null values are allowed.",
    "example": "Map<String, Integer> nightsByCity = new HashMap<>();\nnightsByCity.put(\"Budapest\", 12);\nnightsByCity.put(\"Vienna\", 7);\n\nint nights = nightsByCity.get(\"Budapest\");   // 12\nboolean hasPraha = nightsByCity.containsKey(\"Praha\");   // false\nSystem.out.println(nightsByCity);",
