    "example": "Deque<String> history = new ArrayDeque<>();\nhistory.push(\"list\");    // add to the front\nhistory.push(\"map\");\nhistory.push(\"stream\");\n\nSystem.out.println(history.pop());     // stream\nSystem.out.println(history.peek());    // map\nSystem.out.println(history.size());    // 2",
